      "releaseNotes": "This update from Apple will improve the functionality of this app. No new features are included.\n\nBug Fixed - Offset Widget was only showing half of the controls, now all the controls are visible.",
      "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2018-01-02T23:54:30Z",
