      "releaseNotes": "What's New in 6.8\n\nNEW BENDERS\n• 46 new hand benders from IDEAL, Klein and Greenlee, including IMC and rigid models: IDEAL Aluminum Head and Black Iron, Klein Aerohead, Aluminum Head and Iron Head, and Greenlee SITE-RITE and SITE-RITE II.\n\nEASIER BENDER FILTERING\n• New Type filter: Hand, Mechanical, Electric or Hydraulic.\n• Redesigned filter buttons turn blue when active, so you can see which filters are narrowing your list.\n• Filter labels no longer wrap onto two lines on smaller iPhones.\n• A \"No Matching Benders\" message appears when no bender fits your filters.\n\nFASTER NUMBER ENTRY\n• Just start typing: the first number you enter on the keypad replaces the current value, so there's no need to tap \"C\" first.\n• Redesigned keypad with a larger field name and value at the top and a full-width fraction slider.\n• The angle keypad has quick buttons for 10°, 22.5°, 30° and 45°.",
